{{Quote|Binabian|From the business sign|<ref name="Andor 3" />}}
'''Gyo''' was a business located on the [[planet]] [[Ferrix]] on [[North Stairs Lane]], close to a [[Unidentified droid parts store|store selling droid parts]]. [[Aurebesh]] lettering over the entrance stated the name of the business,<ref name="Andor 3" /> with smaller letters in the upper left hand corner that appeared to read "<small>''[faded]''</small>OIDAPD SHIP,"<ref name="Rix">{{Andor|Rix Road (episode)}}</ref> and the word "BINABIAN" written in smaller letters in the bottom right hand corner.<ref name="Andor 1">{{Andor|Kassa (episode)}}</ref> The name "Gyo" was also printed on a tall building in the industrial area of Ferrix, the same area where the [[BTY-180 carrier|Preox-Morlana personnel carrier]] landed while on a [[Ambush on Ferrix|mission to apprehend Cassian Andor]].<ref name="Andor 3" /><ref name="Reckoning (episode)">In the shot of the [[Corporate Tactical Forces]] disembarking the [[BTY-180 carrier|Preox-Morlana personnel carrier]] in "[[Reckoning (episode)|Reckoning]]," the name "Gyo" appears on a tall building on the right hand side of the [[troop transport]]. It can also be seen in the background as [[Sergeant]] [[Linus Mosk|Mosk]] says, "Copy that, [[North Team]]."</ref>

